WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.803 --> 00:00:03.528
Open Pages and choose Manage page types.

2
00:00:03.528 --> 00:00:06.737
Create a Case Study type for client projects.

3
00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:10.401
Open its template and enable the project story block.

4
00:00:10.401 --> 00:00:15.050
Add the project layout to the starting template.

5
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:24.450
Create a project using the Case Study page type.

6
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:32.046
Give this project its own content.

7
00:00:32.046 --> 00:00:41.691
Create a second case study using the same template.

8
00:00:41.691 --> 00:00:52.571
Same layout, different content for each project.
